        "id": 12209,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-08T00:40:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I ran into this with the app and it seemed odd that it worked that way. &nbsp; So Unity had Volatile Parts out which damages the non hero target with the lowest HP for two. &nbsp; Ambuscade had a Sonic Mine in play, Unity had a Bee Bot in play, and Silver Gulch played Tyler Hayes. &nbsp; I messed up on order and Hayes hit the Sonic Mine so I let it play out. &nbsp; When Bee Bot was destroyed Volatile Parts triggered and damage was dealt to the Sonic Mine. &nbsp; I would have expected Hayes to be the target since Sonic Mine was technically destroyed and wouldn't really have HP. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So is the app correct in having Volatile Parts damage the Sonic Mine?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:40.778Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
