        "raw": "<p>So I ran into this with the app and it seemed odd that it worked that way. &nbsp; So Unity had Volatile Parts out which damages the non hero target with the lowest HP for two. &nbsp; Ambuscade had a Sonic Mine in play, Unity had a Bee Bot in play, and Silver Gulch played Tyler Hayes. &nbsp; I messed up on order and Hayes hit the Sonic Mine so I let it play out. &nbsp; When Bee Bot was destroyed Volatile Parts triggered and damage was dealt to the Sonic Mine. &nbsp; I would have expected Hayes to be the target since Sonic Mine was technically destroyed and wouldn&#39;t really have HP. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So is the app correct in having Volatile Parts damage the Sonic Mine?</p>",
