        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I don&#39;t think so. I think Christopher said that something can&#39;t be destroyed twice (let me see if I can find the link). However, it could have changed after Handelabra talked with Christopher about the app.</p><p>EDIT: Not sure if I read it wrong first, or you changed it, but the app is correct. While something is being destroyed, it is still a target, still ahs hp, and can still be targeted. Handelabra discussed with Christopher at length about how to handle &quot;when destroyed&quot; effects.</p>",
